" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709650/extras/330e3b2138ae49b9f3efa6d197984408.mp4?t=1723226702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power Cards</h2>Amass a collection of formidable cards, which they strategically utilize to engage in battles against fellow online players to capture their flag. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709650/extras/6bf9d1f1becc61f6f20cc7a973692ac7.poster.avif?t=1723226702\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709650/extras/6bf9d1f1becc61f6f20cc7a973692ac7.webm?t=1723226702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709650/extras/6bf9d1f1becc61f6f20cc7a973692ac7.mp4?t=1723226702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summon New Gladiators</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709650/extras/2a21d46a620728153ec668bc9e9b55f7.poster.avif?t=1723226702\" width=480 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709650/extras/2a21d46a620728153ec668bc9e9b55f7.webm?t=1723226702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709650/extras/2a21d46a620728153ec668bc9e9b55f7.mp4?t=1723226702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
